WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.550 --> 00:00:02.840
Schmidt. I got you something, man.

00:00:12.070 --> 00:00:16.690
They didn't have a Jewish star at the store.
So I got you a regular cookie and I made the

00:00:16.690 --> 00:00:22.350
star myself by breaking off the pieces. It's
meant to celebrate your Jewish heritage.

00:00:22.350 --> 00:00:23.000
What is this?

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:24.030
The Jewish star. I just said that.

00:00:24.240 --> 00:00:25.140
Hey, Schmidt, just.

00:00:25.140 --> 00:00:29.250
This is so terrible.

00:00:30.070 --> 00:00:36.910
You gave me cookie, I gave you cookie.
You gave me cookie, gave you cookie.

00:00:36.910 --> 00:00:43.960
Gave me cookie, got you cookie. You gave me cookie, I got you cookie, man. Gave me cookie, got you cookie.

00:00:43.960 --> 00:00:49.710
We're even. We're even, Schmidt. I
mean, what do you want from me? What do you

00:00:49.710 --> 00:00:55.920
want, Schmidt? I've been racking my brain all
day. I walked around the grocery store, man,

00:00:55.920 --> 00:00:57.660
for 45 minutes.

00:00:58.200 --> 00:01:02.390
I didn't know what to get you. Then I was
thinking I was going to get you ramen like we

00:01:02.390 --> 00:01:07.400
used to eat. But you probably eat like, fancy
ramen now with, like, figs in it. I don't

00:01:07.400 --> 00:01:11.210
know, man. You love me too much, Schmidt.

00:01:12.390 --> 00:01:21.710
And you picked the wrong guy. And when are
you going to get that through that giant head of yours?

00:01:21.710 --> 00:01:23.240
I'm just going to let you down, man.

00:01:28.800 --> 00:01:29.640
Are you crying?

00:01:30.240 --> 00:01:31.080
I'm not crying.

00:01:31.500 --> 00:01:33.720
Yeah, you are crying.

00:01:33.720 --> 00:01:34.500
Oh, my God.

00:01:34.500 --> 00:01:38.090
I'm not crying. Guys, just drop it. I
just felt like I did something nice.

00:01:38.090 --> 00:01:38.340
Yes, you are.

00:01:38.340 --> 00:01:39.240
And that's okay.

00:01:39.270 --> 00:01:42.780
Don't say that, man, because that. You know
what I mean.

00:01:42.780 --> 00:01:43.710
Just let it rain, man.

00:01:43.740 --> 00:01:45.990
I got you the cookie, Schmidt. That's the best I
can do, man.

00:01:48.490 --> 00:01:49.660
What about the turtle?

00:01:52.110 --> 00:01:56.200
You're the only turtle I want. You're the
turtle, man.

00:01:56.830 --> 00:02:00.730
I knew I was the turtle.

00:02:00.730 --> 00:02:02.050
Yeah, man, You're the turtle.

00:02:02.670 --> 00:02:06.430
You're the turtle.

00:02:06.430 --> 00:02:07.470
You guys are the best, man.

00:02:07.480 --> 00:02:10.240
I love you guys. I'm sorry. Sorry, man.

00:02:19.440 --> 00:02:20.350
I'm going to.

00:02:21.290 --> 00:02:25.390
Eat my sandwich right here. This is a good
sandwich. See, you guys.

00:02:25.390 --> 00:02:25.930
This needed to happen.

